  assumes $\sum_{z < \left(2\right)^{\operatorname{dim}}} \left(\left(\alpha\left(z\right) \cdot \ket{z}_{q_{\operatorname{band}\left(0, \operatorname{dim}, 1\right)}}\right)\right)$
  ensures $\sum_{z < \left(2\right)^{\operatorname{dim}}} \left(\left(\alpha\left(z\right) \cdot \ket{\left(\operatorname{mod}\left(z, \left(2\right)^{\operatorname{base}}\right) + \left(\left(2\right)^{\operatorname{base}} \cdot \operatorname{vFwd}\left(\left(\operatorname{nSeg} - 1\right), \operatorname{shr}\left(z, \operatorname{base}\right)\right)\right)\right)}_{q_{\operatorname{band}\left(0, \operatorname{dim}, 1\right)}}\right)\right)$
